WEBVTT

00:00:03.048 --> 00:00:03.667
3

00:00:04.381 --> 00:00:06.248
adverbs the frequency

00:00:07.589 --> 00:00:09.171
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1, b

00:00:09.984 --> 00:00:16.584
<v><b>A:</b></v> I always get up at seven o'clock during the week. I start work at eight o'clock every day.

00:00:18.203 --> 00:00:19.955
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2, a

00:00:20.797 --> 00:00:26.206
<v><b>B:</b></v> I often go to the movies after work. About seven or eight times a month.

00:00:27.988 --> 00:00:29.668
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3, c

00:00:30.639 --> 00:00:36.392
<v><b>A:</b></v> I usually finish work at six o'clock. But on Fridays we stop at three o'clock.

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:39.790
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4, f

00:00:39.999 --> 00:00:44.799
<v><b>B:</b></v> I sometimes meet a friend for lunch. About once or twice a month.

00:00:46.542 --> 00:00:48.222
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5, e

00:00:48.736 --> 00:00:52.704
<v><b>A:</b></v> I hardly ever go to the theater. Only once or twice a year.

00:00:54.323 --> 00:00:56.161
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6, d

00:00:56.832 --> 00:00:59.768
<v><b>B:</b></v> I never have coffee. I don’t like it.